    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now differentiating the function we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now equating&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;to find critical points,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now checking the value of function at critical point and boundary point we get,</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 200px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#960;</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>So, we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>min</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>So, the sum will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
